  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education and Protection for Earthquake affected families in Adana and Diyarbakir Turkey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of this project is to ensure equal educational opportunities and increase access to education for children affected by the earthquake by providing the educational materials and enrolment support, decreasing the protection risks children faced and raising awareness of the communities.To achieve this objective, the activities are categorized to create two main outcomes which are (i) Increased access to education of children affected by earthquake and (ii) Decreased protection risks faced by children affected by earthquake.</narrative>
  </description>
